# seed_credentials.txt is deliberately NOT ignored (see README's Demo
# credentials section) - since R-8 every user's password is the same fixed
# DEMO_PASSWORD and every email is a hardcoded literal in scripts/seed.py,
# so this file's content is fully deterministic: byte-for-byte identical on
# every run, on any machine. Committing it is what makes the demo
# credentials visible in the repo itself, not just in a README table.

